# Android Raw Resources
# Place adhan.wav or adhan.mp3 here for notification sounds

# INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Copy your adhan audio file to this folder
# 2. Rename it to: adhan.wav (or adhan.mp3)
# 3. Run: npx cap sync android
# 4. The notification service will automatically use this sound

# Supported formats: .wav, .mp3, .ogg
# File name must be lowercase with no spaces
